+### Quick setup with venv
+
+For a minimal setup using Python's venv:
+
+```bash
+python -m venv .venv
+source .venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+mkdocs serve
+```
+
 ### Install and serve
 
 Fork and clone the repository and its submodules
